#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:3
#: 9aa6daa9d6084ac089fed1f57e42ac6e
msgid "磁序（Magnetic Order）"
msgstr "Magnetic Order"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:5
#: 88b477dec69440adb63efdf1be82b16e
msgid "**分类：** 磁性"
msgstr "**Category:** Magnetism"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:7
#: fa4bb1b15ce149ba966ba3e00accfa06
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:9
#: 6852f808af3841eaad0dc4842ef75730
msgid ""
"根据元素磁矩幅值，从每个输入结构生成 FM、AFM 和随机 PM 初始自旋构型。卡片不改变原子坐标、元素或晶胞；输出统一写入三分量 "
"`spin:R:3`，并同步维护 ASE `initial_magmoms`。"
msgstr ""
"Use element magnetic-moment magnitudes to generate FM, AFM, and random PM"
" initial spin configurations for each input. The card does not change "
"coordinates, elements, or the cell; outputs consistently write three-"
"component `spin:R:3` values and update ASE `initial_magmoms`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:11
#: bacf88b7116a41748b1d9caa803776d1
msgid ""
"这张卡生成的是用于 DFT/NEP 数据准备的**初始自旋端点**，不是磁基态判断器，也不能证明某个输出是真正的热力学 FM、AFM 或 PM "
"相。后续仍需通过电子结构计算、能量比较和收敛后磁矩验证。"
msgstr ""
"This card generates **initial spin endpoints** for DFT/NEP data "
"preparation. It is not a magnetic-ground-state classifier and cannot "
"prove that an output is a thermodynamic FM, AFM, or PM phase. Verify it "
"later with electronic-structure calculations, energy comparisons, and "
"converged magnetic moments."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:13
#: 90b557a082f34bddbcba4023ca9a2a43
msgid "`磁序` 与 `磁矩无序采样` 的职责不同："
msgstr "`Magnetic Order` and `Moment Disorder` have different roles:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:15
#: 394ef2307ee449c99ee1115466a21a8b
#
msgid "`磁序`：建立 FM、AFM 或完全随机 PM 端点。"
msgstr "`Magnetic Order`: create FM, AFM, or fully random PM endpoints."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:16
#: 7fb5ed22d27845df8634cc2690f2f6ea
#
msgid "`磁矩无序采样`：从已有磁态出发，按比例翻转或重新定向一部分磁矩，生成不同无序程度的中间状态。"
msgstr ""
"`Moment Disorder`: start from an existing magnetic state and flip or "
"reorient a fraction of its moments to generate intermediate states with "
"different degrees of disorder."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:18
#: 20997d0e3eed43d684660de67d18e201
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:20
#: 40b7b20d474444ccbb019b902a11ad7e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"程序先为每个原子得到磁矩模长 $m_i$。共线输出写入标量 $m_i s_i$，非共线输出沿参考轴 $\\hat{\\mathbf a}$ 写入 "
"$\\mathbf m_i=m_i s_i\\hat{\\mathbf a}$。三类磁序的符号/方向规则为："
msgstr ""
"The program first obtains a moment magnitude $m_i$ for each atom. "
"Collinear outputs use the scalar $m_i s_i$; non-collinear outputs use "
"$\\mathbf m_i=m_i s_i\\hat{\\mathbf a}$ along the reference axis "
"$\\hat{\\mathbf a}$. The sign and direction rules for the three orders "
"are:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:24
#: 4816c503ff73482193f93f9de697b3c5
msgid "铁磁（FM）：所有磁性原子 $s_i=+1$；"
msgstr "Ferromagnetic (FM): every magnetic atom has $s_i=+1$;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:25
#: eec67824dd3b43eaa156339fee50e976
msgid "反铁磁（AFM）：按 k 向量层号或 A/B 分组交替给出 $s_i=\\pm1$；"
msgstr ""
"Antiferromagnetic (AFM): alternate $s_i=\\pm1$ by k-vector layer index or"
" A/B groups;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:26
#: 3a2dce6e777240c1b8f924360dec14d5
msgid "顺磁近似（PM）：共线模式随机取正负号，非共线模式按球面、圆锥、平面或轴向规则抽方向。"
msgstr ""
"Paramagnetic approximation (PM): choose random signs in collinear mode, "
"or sample directions on a sphere, cone, plane, or axis in non-collinear "
"mode."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:28
#: 6fcd7a68fff6434d881628480b4bf168
msgid "`平衡正负磁矩`只约束有限样本中的正负数量尽量相等，不等价于热力学顺磁系综；这张卡生成 的是用于训练覆盖的磁构型快照，不是在求磁性基态。"
msgstr ""
"`Balance positive and negative moments` only makes the sign counts as "
"equal as possible in a finite sample; it is not a thermodynamic "
"paramagnetic ensemble. This card generates magnetic snapshots for "
"training coverage, not a magnetic ground state."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:31
#: d6792262bb1340b28b675badd84beefd
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:33
#: 9a782d89adc848f48d115145bf21e9cb
msgid "场景：BCC Fe 模型只见过 FM，AFM 测试误差明显更高"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: a BCC Fe model has seen only FM states and has much higher AFM "
"test error"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:35
#: 55034dc401f541179f95a7a11c0d6772
msgid ""
"训练集中的 BCC Fe 全是 FM 初态，模型在分层 AFM 构型上的能量和磁力误差显著增大。需要对同一批几何结构补充 FM、AFM 和随机 "
"PM 自旋端点，分离“几何覆盖不足”和“磁环境覆盖不足”。"
msgstr ""
"All BCC Fe structures in the training set are FM initial states, and "
"energy and magnetic-force errors increase sharply for layered AFM "
"configurations. Add FM, AFM, and random PM spin endpoints for the same "
"geometries to separate insufficient geometric coverage from insufficient "
"magnetic-environment coverage."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:37
#: c900924943a047aea60661c078188adf
msgid "**输入：** 2×2×2 BCC Fe 周期超胞。"
msgstr "**Input:** a 2×2×2 periodic BCC Fe supercell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:39
#: d49efbf7329f4df78ad495dbfefa8f2c
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:41
#: 7b0768bbb01a4460b8712860fb04ecc6
msgid "`自旋模型`（`format`） = `collinear`"
msgstr "`Spin model` (`format`) = `collinear`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:42
#: 1720e708a1d544b0a7296b967613a1ba
msgid "`参考轴`（`axis`） = `[0, 0, 1]`"
msgstr "`Reference axis` (`axis`) = `[0, 0, 1]`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:43
#: c9aa0bde49b0468ea50439b4c160f83e
msgid "`Element moments` = `Fe:2.2`"
msgstr "`Element moments` = `Fe:2.2`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:44
#: c2776035be994de3aa91ffb692c0a920
msgid "开启 FM、AFM 和 PM"
msgstr "Enable FM, AFM, and PM"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:45
#: dcd2c542726d462597554eb7205cfd79
msgid "`AFM 分配方式`（`afm_mode`） = `k_vector`"
msgstr "`AFM assignment mode` (`afm_mode`) = `k_vector`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:46
#: f0590494755c43acb4dc2a1c9c2a4d5b
msgid "`AFM 层向量`（`afm_kvec`） = `111`"
msgstr "`AFM layer vector` (`afm_kvec`) = `111`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:47
#: c98041fa934e42d9971d9b62caddf0cc
msgid "`PM structures per input` = `8`"
msgstr "`PM structures per input` = `8`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:48
#: 4b7189497b7c473f98c55f0807d73915
msgid "开启`使用随机种子`并把`随机种子`设为 `42`"
msgstr "Enable `Use seed` and set `Seed` to `42`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:50
#: 1754155ec6684a5e85002103a49b1178
msgid ""
"**运行前检查：** 首输入预览应显示 16 个磁性原子、AFM `+8/-8`，并给出每个输入及整个数据集的预计输出数量。如果 AFM "
"只有一个符号，先扩胞或更换 layer vector。"
msgstr ""
"**Before running:** the first-input preview should show 16 magnetic "
"atoms, AFM `+8/-8`, and estimated output counts per input and for the "
"dataset. If AFM has only one sign, expand the cell or change the layer "
"vector."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:52
#: 330ba6f09c4a44afb2b1e418f59f6620
msgid "**输出：** 每个输入生成 1 个 FM、1 个 AFM 和 8 个随机 PM，共 10 个结构。"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** each input produces one FM, one AFM, and eight random PM "
"structures, for ten structures total."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:54
#: 2a7efeeece7f463b9bcb84f01cb03cbc
msgid "**验证改善：**"
msgstr "**Validate the improvement:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:56
#: 86d02ea75af34f07a884b3703c42130d
msgid "检查 FM 自旋沿参考轴同向，AFM 同时包含正负号。"
msgstr ""
"Check that FM spins align along the reference axis and AFM contains both "
"signs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:57
#: 8cfdbbf2d816493c92ef6ae3bed48704
msgid "固定 seed 后重复运行，PM 自旋应逐帧一致。"
msgstr "Repeat the run with a fixed seed; PM spins should match frame by frame."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:58
#: 567b7a20ea004c5e8e6e7f135952cebd
msgid "重训后分别比较 FM、AFM 和随机 PM 测试切片，不能只看混合总 RMSE。"
msgstr ""
"After retraining, compare FM, AFM, and random-PM test slices separately; "
"do not rely only on the mixed overall RMSE."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:60
#: cab1554417e9429e9068a7c9b716d85a
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:62
#: 8bd3723a4b694131a7e47cc0cff3e1ed
msgid "自旋模型和磁矩幅值"
msgstr "Spin model and moment magnitudes"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:64
#: d86e486fa5f14da890192673fc112533
msgid "自旋模型（format）"
msgstr "format"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:66
#: 2a73f09a4adb4ea0a604af550b66c29e
msgid "`str`，默认 `collinear`。"
msgstr "`str`, default `collinear`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:68
#: 2f756043d6784bd68d8611845e9b1c05
msgid "`collinear`：所有输出沿参考轴，只改变正负符号。"
msgstr ""
"`collinear`: all outputs lie along the reference axis; only the sign "
"changes."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:69
#: 045b09539e9d4719b6e388b81007b741
msgid "`noncollinear`：FM/AFM 可使用三维参考方向，PM 可在球面、锥面、平面或参考轴上取向。"
msgstr ""
"`noncollinear`: FM/AFM may use a three-dimensional reference direction; "
"PM may orient on a sphere, cone, plane, or reference axis."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:71
#: 7a278380d61c4d298d5d9472bb721317
msgid ""
"旧项目中的 `Collinear (scalar)` 和 `Non-collinear (vector)` "
"会继续读取。这里的“模型”描述允许的自旋方向，不是文件格式；导出的规范字段始终是 `spin:R:3`。"
msgstr ""
"Legacy `Collinear (scalar)` and `Non-collinear (vector)` values remain "
"readable. Here `model` describes allowed spin directions, not the file "
"format; the canonical exported field is always `spin:R:3`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:73
#: 31961bdf91b5406ba3c5bb2bd3e7c843
msgid "参考轴（axis）"
msgstr "axis"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:75
#: 9f36f2a1748747b1825273a91cbd9ac1
msgid "`[x, y, z]`，默认 `[0, 0, 1]`。必须是有限的非零三分量向量。程序内部会归一化："
msgstr ""
"`[x, y, z]`, default `[0, 0, 1]`. It must be a finite, nonzero three-"
"component vector. The program normalizes it internally:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:77
#: 92ba8cd5b1994f638a3fb2cd25a2027c
#, python-brace-format
msgid "共线 FM/AFM/PM 使用 $\\pm\\hat{\\mathbf a}$。"
msgstr "Collinear FM/AFM/PM use $\\pm\\hat{\\mathbf a}$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:78
#: eb3b852c9b894917bf16281d1f9a5c3c
msgid "非共线 FM/AFM 默认以它为方向。"
msgstr "Non-collinear FM/AFM use it as the default direction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:79
#: 598a571345f0490dbb0d9712dbbdd484
msgid "非共线 PM 的 cone、plane 和 axis 分布以它为参考。"
msgstr ""
"The cone, plane, and axis distributions for non-collinear PM use it as "
"the reference."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:81
#: 2ee648a0579346218235dff938805801
msgid "元素磁矩（magmom_map）"
msgstr "magmom_map"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:83
#: 1601781a1fae4b719d711785555ba779
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`str`，默认空。界面使用“元素 / 磁矩模长”表格，单位为 $\\mu_\\mathrm{B}$；序列化仍使用逐元素映射："
msgstr ""
"`str`, empty by default. The interface uses an `Element / Moment "
"magnitude` table in $\\mu_\\mathrm{B}$; serialization continues to use a "
"per-element mapping:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:85
#: 8e9558782e9e462ca717342e70db934c
msgid "Fe:2.2,Co:1.7,Ni:0.6\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:89
#: af178ebf5549431f8bae405bcb88286a
msgid "非共线模式也接受向量值；向量的模长同时决定磁矩大小："
msgstr ""
"Non-collinear mode also accepts vector values; the vector norm determines"
" the moment magnitude:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:91
#: d3085ca755a54b1a81c4940ced0879d7
msgid "Fe:[0,0,2.2],Cr:[0,0,-1.5]\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:95
#: bf15a0cde8cb4bbaa30c9be3e7808eb1
msgid "也可使用 JSON："
msgstr "JSON is also accepted:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:97
#: 5f9afee54d2a4b80b991fff9fa0ce251
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{\"Fe\": [0, 0, 2.2], \"Cr\": [0, 0, -1.5]}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:101
#: f00824ef4a5f498789714b39e7a3c9b1
msgid "使用元素向量方向（use_element_dirs）"
msgstr "use_element_dirs"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:103
#: 0d435fda63024f73ad8e81d4b273353a
msgid "`bool`，默认 false，仅非共线 FM/AFM 使用。开启后，向量形式的元素条目会成为该元素的参考方向，AFM 再在这些方向上施加正负号。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default false; used only by non-collinear FM/AFM. When enabled, "
"vector-valued element entries become the reference direction for each "
"element, and AFM applies positive or negative signs along those "
"directions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:105
#: 560608936e9341a4b4369e06e0b05db4
msgid ""
"开启此项后，`MagFMnc` 表示所有原子使用 FM 正号分支，并不保证不同元素的向量彼此平行。普通 FM/AFM "
"数据准备建议保持关闭；需要自定义多元素方向时应仔细检查输出。"
msgstr ""
"When enabled, `MagFMnc` means that all atoms use the positive FM branch; "
"it does not guarantee parallel vectors across different elements. Keep it"
" disabled for ordinary FM/AFM data preparation and inspect outputs "
"carefully when customizing multielement directions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:107
#: f092ebab66614f5380e6f01cd00268b1
msgid "未列元素磁矩（default_moment）"
msgstr "default_moment"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:109
#: 04524a87180e45b2991a7658e291857e
msgid "`float`，默认 `0.0`。对作用范围内、但未出现在 `元素磁矩`（`magmom_map`）中的元素使用该非负磁矩幅值。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.0`. Use this nonnegative moment magnitude for in-"
"scope elements absent from `Element moments` (`magmom_map`)."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:111
#: 19288ca84ef74d7ab63ecf2f3eb21038
msgid "仅作用于元素（apply_elements）"
msgstr "apply_elements"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:113
#: 75eeb4a798a74431933c4658e25b2a15
msgid "`str`，默认空。逗号分隔，例如 `Fe,Co`。非空时，只有列出的元素参与磁矩映射；其他元素磁矩为 0。留空时考虑全部元素。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default empty. Enter comma-separated elements such as `Fe,Co`. "
"When nonempty, only listed elements participate in moment mapping and all"
" others have zero moments. When empty, all elements are considered."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:115
#: 4e8890fed06c4374b45c1399d2075549
msgid ""
"执行顺序是：先按 `仅作用于元素`（`apply_elements`）选择元素，再从 "
"`元素磁矩`（`magmom_map`）读取幅值，未命中时使用 "
"`未列元素磁矩`（`default_moment`）。如果最终没有任何非零磁矩，卡片明确失败，不生成带错误磁序标签的全零结构。"
msgstr ""
"The order is: select elements with `Apply only to elements` "
"(`apply_elements`), read magnitudes from `Element moments` "
"(`magmom_map`), and use `Unlisted-element moment` (`default_moment`) for "
"misses. If no nonzero moments remain, the card fails explicitly instead "
"of generating an all-zero structure with a misleading magnetic-order "
"label."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:117
#: 1e14e2600be4429bb18df46b8d538fb4
msgid "输出分支"
msgstr "Output branches"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:119
#: f188acb782db46749c3005558d6eaee8
msgid "生成 FM（gen_fm）"
msgstr "gen_fm"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:121
#: fb8afeb841994cbbb189de93e34a19c7
msgid "`bool`，默认 true。生成一个正号 FM 分支。"
msgstr "`bool`, default true. Generate one positive-sign FM branch."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:123
#: b203e8265f634042ae576cc91634e070
msgid "生成 AFM（gen_afm）"
msgstr "gen_afm"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:125
#: 1eec9892da634a4b887a45bbf5345b24
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。开启后生成一个 AFM 分支，并显示 AFM 分配参数。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default false. When enabled, generate one AFM branch and show AFM"
" assignment parameters."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:127
#: cc450935969c4f9792fd0d65ddf39342
msgid "生成随机 PM（gen_pm）"
msgstr "gen_pm"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:129
#: 14c39dab19e041cc8bfe8ccb9dd19995
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。开启后生成 `每个输入的 PM 数量`（`pm_count`）个随机 PM 初始态。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default false. When enabled, generate `PM structures per input` "
"(`pm_count`) random PM initial states."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:131
#: ad90ed4ff1f944c393269269010ddd9f
msgid "FM、AFM 和 PM 至少要开启一个；全部关闭会明确失败。"
msgstr ""
"At least one of FM, AFM, and PM must be enabled; disabling all three "
"fails explicitly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:133
#: 0deafabaeaf5415e9363b0bb6ffeeaa9
msgid "AFM 分配"
msgstr "AFM assignment"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:135
#: 828fcee1501548e7bdc7ee3d4f795742
msgid "AFM 分配方式（afm_mode）"
msgstr "afm_mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:137
#: 3a03a8e51cd04cc48ddaf8f137eec969
msgid "`str`，默认 `k_vector`。"
msgstr "`str`, default `k_vector`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:139
#: 3f0bf60e341143af8beaac01e5580226
msgid "`k_vector`：按当前晶胞的分数坐标层交替分配正负号。"
msgstr ""
"`k_vector`: alternate signs by fractional-coordinate layers of the "
"current cell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:140
#: 93fd88bbcd874e7d8c2048752fea664d
msgid "`group_ab`：读取已有的 `atoms.arrays[\"group\"]`，由两个标签指定正负号。"
msgstr ""
"`group_ab`: read the existing `atoms.arrays[\"group\"]` and assign signs "
"from two labels."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:142
#: cd6158f4ba3d41ef83619a02e7c4796d
msgid "旧值 `k-vector` 和 `group A/B` 会继续读取。group 模式缺少输入标签时不会再静默退回 k-vector。"
msgstr ""
"Legacy values `k-vector` and `group A/B` remain readable. If group mode "
"lacks input labels, it no longer silently falls back to k-vector."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:144
#: 492b8396352b400d81fc2796661b4fe5
msgid "AFM 层向量（afm_kvec）"
msgstr "afm_kvec"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:146
#: 15812ca0dc3d46a19de58e43e9a1bd4f
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `111`，仅 `k_vector` 使用。可选 `100`、`010`、`001`、`110` 和 "
"`111`，分别对应当前晶胞分数坐标中的 a、b、c、a+b 和 a+b+c 相位方向。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `111`, used only by `k_vector`. Choose `100`, `010`, "
"`001`, `110`, or `111`, corresponding to phase directions a, b, c, a+b, "
"and a+b+c in the current cell's fractional coordinates."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:148
#: 6b9cc2df87344588a5943ecd9db84b8c
msgid "该规则依赖当前晶胞和坐标原点。若磁性原子只产生一种符号，卡片会要求扩胞或更换向量，而不是把 FM-like 结果标成 AFM。"
msgstr ""
"This rule depends on the current cell and coordinate origin. If magnetic "
"atoms produce only one sign, the card requires a larger cell or a "
"different vector rather than labeling the FM-like result as AFM."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:150
#: dcb2f4a5dccf4bd8b2609efa03d7be15
msgid "AFM 正号组（afm_group_a）"
msgstr "afm_group_a"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:152
#: 84847a582b104038ac717259835f6b41
msgid "`str`，默认 `A`，仅 `group_ab` 使用。必须非空，并在磁性原子中至少匹配一个输入 `group`。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `A`, used only by `group_ab`. It must be nonempty and "
"match at least one input `group` among magnetic atoms."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:154
#: 00fa06d5b2ad49ba96107e442821828a
msgid "AFM 负号组（afm_group_b）"
msgstr "afm_group_b"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:156
#: 451e980f508e4ecea5ca99a3142b9906
msgid "`str`，默认 `B`，仅 `group_ab` 使用。必须非空、与正号组不同，并在磁性原子中至少匹配一个输入 `group`。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `B`, used only by `group_ab`. It must be nonempty, differ "
"from the positive-sign group, and match at least one input `group` among "
"magnetic atoms."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:158
#: 112dffdcaa2741b6ba70e73fafa927e4
msgid "其他分组置零（afm_zero_unknown）"
msgstr "afm_zero_unknown"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:160
#: dc4a599984cc46c386a63433e53a29ce
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 true。开启时，不属于正号组或负号组的原子磁矩置零；关闭时，这些原子使用正号。该设置不会把 `group` 当成晶体学 "
"`sublattice`。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default true. When enabled, atoms outside the positive- or "
"negative-sign groups receive zero moments; when disabled, they use the "
"positive sign. This setting does not interpret `group` as a "
"crystallographic `sublattice`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:162
#: 296d8424dc544939b2ea784a0705e8e4
msgid "随机 PM"
msgstr "Random PM"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:164
#: 80c3500b6b89428f9d99ad89a3c6843e
msgid "每个输入的 PM 数量（pm_count）"
msgstr "pm_count"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:166
#: f8effae9ebff473893c1438a6faa0c1d
msgid "`int`，默认 `10`，最小为 1。总输出数为已开启的 FM/AFM 分支数加 `每个输入的 PM 数量`（`pm_count`）。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `10`, minimum 1. Total outputs equal the enabled FM/AFM "
"branches plus `PM structures per input` (`pm_count`)."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:168
#: 14e9edc19d1a46748c2455dfb67b1f0b
msgid "PM 方向分布（pm_direction）"
msgstr "pm_direction"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:170
#: 7e83e552ac934d198c921467d90cef60
msgid "`str`，默认 `sphere`，仅非共线 PM 生效。"
msgstr "`str`, default `sphere`, used only for non-collinear PM."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:172
#: 887acf3f54fd4522a25f7c3330818409
msgid "`sphere`：整个球面均匀随机。"
msgstr "`sphere`: uniform random directions over the full sphere."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:173
#: d1a2b5f837f64b3f982a2c6e5fee7814
msgid "`cone`：参考轴周围的锥内随机。"
msgstr "`cone`: random directions within a cone around the reference axis."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:174
#: 060c6121d22c4e86ae100b5682d620f7
msgid "`plane`：垂直于参考轴的平面内随机。"
msgstr ""
"`plane`: random directions in the plane perpendicular to the reference "
"axis."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:175
#: 2d8321ccfd6747af9890d54464f5eaa1
msgid "`参考轴`（`axis`）：沿参考轴随机取正负方向。"
msgstr ""
"`Reference axis` (`axis`): randomly choose the positive or negative "
"reference-axis direction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:177
#: 3d9886b9cffb49ceb8eab2f930cb8d3d
msgid "共线 PM 始终沿参考轴随机取正负号，不使用该参数。"
msgstr ""
"Collinear PM always chooses a random sign along the reference axis and "
"does not use this parameter."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:179
#: 1ba019073c6746498c6cf46c71c3bc74
msgid "PM 锥半角（pm_cone_angle）"
msgstr "pm_cone_angle"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:181
#: c2d00b34f51c43f59ab638c6e923252d
msgid "`float`，默认 `30.0`，范围 0–180°，仅非共线 `cone` 使用。"
msgstr "`float`, default `30.0`, range 0–180°, used only by non-collinear `cone`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:183
#: f24ab9c27ae64ee2885ed64d9ad745b0
msgid "按模长配对反向 PM（pm_balanced）"
msgstr "pm_balanced"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:185
#: 92e41d98c09c42bc8438c015a02c6018
msgid "`bool`，默认 true。程序按相同磁矩模长分别生成反向方向对；完整配对会精确抵消，某一模长对应奇数个原子时可能留下一个残余磁矩。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default true. The program generates opposite-direction pairs for "
"equal moment magnitudes; complete pairs cancel exactly, while an odd "
"number of atoms at one magnitude may leave a residual moment."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:187
#: 54887721230f4296886a8a832499b29a
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"在 `cone` 模式下，开启配对意味着方向分布在 $+\\hat{\\mathbf a}$ 和 $-\\hat{\\mathbf a}$ "
"两个锥内，而不是通过减均值破坏锥角限制。"
msgstr ""
"In `cone` mode, pairing distributes directions within cones around both "
"$+\\hat{\\mathbf a}$ and $-\\hat{\\mathbf a}$ rather than subtracting the"
" mean and violating the cone-angle limit."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:189
#: dd1843051dfd44579c39948c436c2987
msgid "随机性和输出预算"
msgstr "Randomness and output budget"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:191
#: fcf181a8e2d5409e87cafe383a1b12be
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "Use Random Seed (use_seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:193
#: 64392ec8ed9b43b09a563b3a11fc4ba7
msgid "`bool`，默认 false，仅 PM 分支使用。开启后，seed、输入结构稳定标识和 PM 序号共同决定随机状态。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default false, used only for PM branches. When enabled, the seed,"
" stable input-structure identifier, and PM index jointly determine the "
"random state."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:195
#: ef50cf75f83f424c8e53754b065fc99a
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "Random Seed (seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:197
#: 82689ab49f294ee4bfd0a20a581a12c6
msgid "`int`，默认 `0`，必须非负。"
msgstr "`int`, default `0`, must be non-negative."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:199
#: 3f574ae4567b4571b248d740e4698380
msgid "每个输入最大输出（max_outputs）"
msgstr "max_outputs"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:201
#: 58e85dad636e48f0ada2fba05dbd8dcb
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 `100`，最小为 1。如果 FM、AFM 和 PM 的预计输出总数超过该值，卡片明确失败，防止误设 `每个输入的 PM "
"数量`（`pm_count`）后生成过量结构。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `100`, minimum 1. If the estimated total FM, AFM, and PM "
"outputs exceed this value, the card fails explicitly to prevent an "
"accidental excessive output count from `PM structures per input` "
"(`pm_count`)."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:203
#: 8ab54542a9c748e08125668076657219
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:205
#: f309735e392d4988addf4fc06a88a87e
msgid "FM 单端点"
msgstr "FM single endpoint"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:207
#: 682e1b74e3604f3eb6a7c181fcf0cb8d
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"MagneticOrderCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"format\": \"collinear\",\n"
"    \"axis\": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0],\n"
"    \"magmom_map\": \"Fe:2.2\",\n"
"    \"use_element_dirs\": false,\n"
"    \"default_moment\": 0.0,\n"
"    \"apply_elements\": \"Fe\",\n"
"    \"gen_fm\": true,\n"
"    \"gen_afm\": false,\n"
"    \"afm_mode\": \"k_vector\",\n"
"    \"afm_kvec\": \"111\",\n"
"    \"afm_group_a\": \"A\",\n"
"    \"afm_group_b\": \"B\",\n"
"    \"afm_zero_unknown\": true,\n"
"    \"gen_pm\": false,\n"
"    \"pm_count\": 10,\n"
"    \"pm_direction\": \"sphere\",\n"
"    \"pm_cone_angle\": 30.0,\n"
"    \"pm_balanced\": true,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": false,\n"
"    \"seed\": 0,\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 100\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:237
#: 5f43083292af420bae9028c589df0964
msgid "FM + 分层 AFM + 共线 PM"
msgstr "FM + layered AFM + collinear PM"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:239
#: 6408d4ba7d5f4bd8a91a1f9990ade241
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"MagneticOrderCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"format\": \"collinear\",\n"
"    \"axis\": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0],\n"
"    \"magmom_map\": \"Fe:2.2\",\n"
"    \"use_element_dirs\": false,\n"
"    \"default_moment\": 0.0,\n"
"    \"apply_elements\": \"Fe\",\n"
"    \"gen_fm\": true,\n"
"    \"gen_afm\": true,\n"
"    \"afm_mode\": \"k_vector\",\n"
"    \"afm_kvec\": \"111\",\n"
"    \"afm_group_a\": \"A\",\n"
"    \"afm_group_b\": \"B\",\n"
"    \"afm_zero_unknown\": true,\n"
"    \"gen_pm\": true,\n"
"    \"pm_count\": 8,\n"
"    \"pm_direction\": \"sphere\",\n"
"    \"pm_cone_angle\": 30.0,\n"
"    \"pm_balanced\": true,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42,\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 20\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:269
#: 214c11b3b43f4d429944d2b2038ff9d4
msgid "非共线球面 PM"
msgstr "Non-collinear spherical PM"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:271
#: 09ca90ea7c5b46c09b61ba4b337efdc0
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"MagneticOrderCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"format\": \"noncollinear\",\n"
"    \"axis\": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0],\n"
"    \"magmom_map\": \"Fe:2.2,Co:1.7\",\n"
