"    \"afm_group_b\": \"B\",\n"
"    \"afm_zero_unknown\": true,\n"
"    \"gen_pm\": true,\n"
"    \"pm_count\": 16,\n"
"    \"pm_direction\": \"sphere\",\n"
"    \"pm_cone_angle\": 30.0,\n"
"    \"pm_balanced\": true,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 7,\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 20\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:301
#: e4ed6a93bdd942559107f63f55d5b6c3
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:303
#: 0b8ba7cdcdd14a319ab24eadd62105bf
#
msgid "`原子层分组` → `磁序`：先生成逐层交替的 A/B 标签，再用 `group_ab` 赋予 AFM 正负号。"
msgstr ""
"`Layer Groups` → `Magnetic Order`: first generate alternating A/B labels "
"by layer, then use `group_ab` to assign AFM signs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:304
#: cde4a3ced1964c729f845c6336ebaaf3
#
msgid "`磁序` → `磁矩无序采样`：先建立 FM/AFM 端点，再扫描局部无序比例。"
msgstr ""
"`Magnetic Order` → `Moment Disorder`: establish FM/AFM endpoints first, "
"then scan the local disorder fraction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:305
#: 859a8e6a9a2840f1989bd1d0356de446
msgid "`磁序` → `局域磁响应`：在端点附近补充确定性小角响应。"
msgstr "`Magnetic Order` → `Local Magnetic Response`: add deterministic small-angle responses around the endpoints."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:306
#: bb765a4644684dbb8b51161d382d6740
#
msgid "`磁序` → `SOC / 纹理响应`：先建立参考磁态，再生成位置连续的有限 q 磁纹理。"
msgstr ""
"`Magnetic Order` → `SOC / Texture Response`: establish a reference "
"magnetic state before generating position-continuous finite-q textures."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:308
#: e6dc13e9fe9f4cdca4f63506c1e4ab0b
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:310
#: 5300f1a55ffb43ebb323443175c45922
msgid ""
"**预览提示没有非零磁矩。** `元素磁矩`（`magmom_map`）为空、磁矩都是 0，或 "
"`仅作用于元素`（`apply_elements`）排除了所有映射元素。卡片不会把全零自旋标成 FM/AFM/PM。"
msgstr ""
"**The preview reports no nonzero moments.** `Element moments` "
"(`magmom_map`) is empty, all moments are zero, or `Apply only to "
"elements` (`apply_elements`) excludes every mapped element. The card does"
" not label an all-zero spin as FM/AFM/PM."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:312
#: df395b5f3ad24bf68c3f2f37c7d2e914
msgid "**AFM 提示只有一个符号。** 当前晶胞在所选 k-vector 下没有足够的交替相位。先扩胞或更换 layer vector。"
msgstr ""
"**The AFM preview contains only one sign.** The current cell does not "
"provide enough alternating phases for the selected k-vector. Enlarge the "
"cell or choose another layer vector."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:314
#: 69386ec4d3ba45dca673e874b4088b40
msgid ""
"**group 模式提示缺少 A/B。** 输入必须已有 "
"`atoms.arrays[\"group\"]`，且正负标签各自至少匹配一个非零磁矩原子。不会自动识别晶体学子晶格，也不会静默回退。"
msgstr ""
"**The group mode reports missing A/B groups.** The input must already "
"contain `atoms.arrays[\"group\"]`, and each sign label must match at "
"least one atom with a nonzero moment. The card does not infer "
"crystallographic sublattices or silently fall back."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:316
#: 5bb6517edf324cb49809f6316b3f21ce
msgid "**配对后的 PM 净磁矩仍不完全为零。** 某种磁矩模长对应奇数个原子时会留下一个未配对方向；不同模长之间不会通过改变模长强行抵消。"
msgstr ""
"**The paired PM net moment is not exactly zero.** An odd number of atoms "
"with a given moment magnitude leaves one unpaired direction; different "
"magnitudes are not forcibly canceled by changing their sizes."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:318
#: 9a62ab02372041889611575c3bcb0e0c
#
msgid "**PM 和磁矩无序采样是否重复。** PM 分支把全部磁性原子直接放到一个随机端点；`磁矩无序采样` 能按比例只改变部分已有磁矩并扫描中间无序度。"
msgstr ""
"**Are PM and Moment Disorder redundant?** A PM branch places all magnetic"
" atoms directly in one random endpoint, whereas `Moment Disorder` can "
"alter only a selected fraction of existing moments and scan intermediate "
"disorder levels."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:320
#: f4ebeeb2583f48099eab461629410ad6
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:322
#: d4110d9bcb174ccfbc3e594864959362
msgid "`MagFM` / `MagFMnc`：共线 / 非共线 FM 正号分支。"
msgstr "`MagFM` / `MagFMnc`: collinear / non-collinear positive-sign FM branches."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:323
#: 3ee353dd34ce44818c6ae85e15f47851
msgid "`MagAFM111` / `MagAFM111nc`：按 k-vector 生成的 AFM。"
msgstr "`MagAFM111` / `MagAFM111nc`: AFM generated from a k-vector."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:324
#: c069e404df90446c84657e28a3e6318b
msgid "`MagAFMg` / `MagAFMgnc`：按现有 group 标签生成的 AFM。"
msgstr "`MagAFMg` / `MagAFMgnc`: AFM generated from existing group labels."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:325
#: cdabcfa3903b4c6885ebbac7ff72f694
msgid "`MagPM` / `MagPMnc`：随机 PM；固定 seed 时标签带派生 seed。"
msgstr ""
"`MagPM` / `MagPMnc`: random PM; with a fixed seed, the label includes the"
" derived seed."

